>> ALL RIGHT. I HAVE TWO ITEMS TODAY,

00:21:10.371 --> 00:21:15.976
COLLEAGUES WANTED TO LET YOU KNOW THAT I'LL BE HAVING MY

00:21:15.976 --> 00:21:17.312
FIFTH HEARING ON TRAFFIC ENFORCEMENT IN SAN FRANCISCO ON

00:21:17.312 --> 00:21:20.915
SEPTEMBER 25TH AT THE PUBLIC SAFETY AND NEIGHBORHOOD

00:21:20.915 --> 00:21:25.386
SERVICES COMMITTEE. IF CHAIR DORSEY WERE HERE I

00:21:25.386 --> 00:21:26.521
WOULD THANK HIM. I WANT TO THANK THE OTHER

00:21:26.521 --> 00:21:28.656
MEMBERS OF THE COMMITTEE FOR FINDING TIME FOR US TO CONTINUE

00:21:28.656 --> 00:21:32.460
OUR ONGOING DIALOG WITH S.F. PD AND S.F. MTA ON THE TOPIC AND I

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:38.800
WANT TO THANK SUPERVISOR SHERYL FOR SIGNING ON AS A CO-SPONSOR

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:39.868
. WE DO HAVE SOME GOOD NEWS AHEAD

00:21:39.868 --> 00:21:42.603
OF THIS HEARING. THE STEEP AND AND STEADY

00:21:42.603 --> 00:21:46.274
DECLINE IN TRAFFIC CITATIONS GOING BACK TO 2014 APPEARS TO

00:21:46.274 --> 00:21:50.780
HAVE FINALLY STOPPED AND WE HAVE SEEN A MODEST BUT

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:53.748
SUSTAINED INCREASE IN SITE CITATIONS SINCE THE LATEST

00:21:53.748 --> 00:21:57.840
REPORTS SHOW A 21 AND 21% INCREASE IN TRAFFIC CITATIONS

00:21:57.840 --> 00:22:02.289
FOR THE FIRST HALF OF 2025 COMPARED TO THE FIRST HALF OF

00:22:02.289 --> 00:22:05.159
2024 AND THAT'S AFTER A 59% INCREASE IN CITATIONS FOR 2024

00:22:05.159 --> 00:22:08.759
OVER 2023. WE'RE ALSO BEGINNING TO SEE

00:22:09.383 --> 00:22:12.320
MEASURABLE POSITIVE RESULTS FROM THE SPEED SAFETY CAMERAS

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:13.788
INSTALLED AT 33 LOCATIONS IN THE CITY EARLIER THIS YEAR.

00:22:13.788 --> 00:22:17.992
LAST WEEK I JOINED WALK US FROM THE EREKA VALLEY NEIGHBORHOOD

00:22:17.992 --> 00:22:20.728
ASSOCIATION, MY DISTRICT TO CELEBRATE THE 15% DECREASE

00:22:20.728 --> 00:22:23.865
IN SPEEDING EVENTS DURING THE FIRST TWO MONTHS OF OPERATION

00:22:23.865 --> 00:22:27.335
OF THE CAMERA ON MARKET BETWEEN DANVERS AND DOUGLAS WHERE

00:22:27.335 --> 00:22:31.473
MULTIPLE HOMES HAD BEEN CRASHED INTO OVER THE YEARS AND CARS AS

00:22:31.473 --> 00:22:35.100
WELL PARKED ON THE SIDE OF THE STREET OVER ALL THE CORRIDORS

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:37.945
WHERE CAMERAS HAVE BEEN INSTALLED HAVE SEEN AN AVERAGE

00:22:37.945 --> 00:22:41.416
30% REDUCTION IN SPEEDING WITH THE BIGGEST CHANGES ON HIGH

00:22:41.416 --> 00:22:44.753
VOLUME CORRIDORS LIKE FULTON WHICH SAW A 63% DECREASE OVER

00:22:44.753 --> 00:22:47.822
13 WEEKS. GENEVA WHICH SAW A 45% DECREASE

00:22:47.822 --> 00:22:50.892
OVER EIGHT WEEKS AND BAYSHORE BOULEVARD WHICH SAW A 40%

00:22:50.892 --> 00:22:54.562
DECREASE OVER SEVEN WEEKS. >> NOW THIS IS NOT TO SAY THAT

00:22:54.562 --> 00:22:57.766
THERE'S NOT MORE WORK TO DO. THERE'S LOTS S.F. PD'S TRAFFIC

00:22:57.766 --> 00:23:01.236
COMPANY REMAINS WOEFULLY UNDERSTAFFED AND ENFORCEMENT

00:23:01.236 --> 00:23:04.639
LEVELS EVEN WITH THE INCREASES I DESCRIBED REMAIN FAR BELOW

00:23:04.639 --> 00:23:05.706
2014 LEVELS. AND ALTHOUGH WE'RE SEEING

00:23:05.706 --> 00:23:08.910
IMPROVEMENTS IN VEHICLE SPEEDS IN LOCATIONS WHERE WE HAVE BEEN

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:12.447
ABLE TO INSTALL SPEED CAMERAS, STATE LAW CURRENTLY PREVENTS US

00:23:12.447 --> 00:23:13.381
FROM WIDER USE OF THAT TECHNOLOGY.

00:23:13.381 --> 00:23:16.385
NONETHELESS IT'S IMPORTANT TO ACKNOWLEDGE PROGRESS WHERE WE

00:23:16.385 --> 00:23:19.854
SEE IT AND IT DOES SEEM LIKE WE FINALLY HAVE SOME CLEAR SIGNS

00:23:19.854 --> 00:23:20.922
OF PROGRESS. AT THIS HEARING WE'RE GOING TO

00:23:20.922 --> 00:23:24.258
EXPLORE HOW TO BUILD ON THAT PROGRESS OVER THE LAST DECADE

00:23:24.258 --> 00:23:27.329
AS THE MTA HAS INSTALLED TRAFFIC CALMING INFRASTRUCTURE

00:23:27.329 --> 00:23:31.660
IMPROVEMENTS ACROSS THE CITY AND BUT FRANKLY WITHOUT THE

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:32.467
IMPROVEMENTS IN TRAFFIC FATALITY AND SEVERE INJURY DATA

00:23:32.467 --> 00:23:35.470
THAT WE WOULD ALL LIKE TO SEE. AND THANK YOU SUPERVISOR MELGAR

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:39.730
FOR YOUR MELGAR FOR YOUR LEADERSHIP AND CONGRATULATIONS

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:42.677
ON ON YOUR RESOLUTION THAT WE JUST PASSED.

00:23:42.677 --> 00:23:45.747
I BELIEVE THAT ENFORCEMENT HAS BEEN THE MISSING ELEMENT

00:23:45.747 --> 00:23:47.820
AND I'M HOPEFUL THAT AS WE FINALLY ARE ABLE TO ADD

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:50.485
INCREASED ENFORCEMENT TO THE MIX, WE WILL FINALLY BE ABLE TO

00:23:50.485 --> 00:23:53.822
MOVE OR AT LEAST TO APPROACH OUR GOAL OF ZERO TRAFFIC

00:23:53.822 --> 00:23:57.425
FATALITIES AND SEVERE INJURIES. AS I'VE SAID BEFORE, WE CAN

00:23:57.425 --> 00:23:58.827
AND SHOULD USE EVERY TOOL THAT WE CAN TO PROTECT THE LIVES OF

00:23:58.827 --> 00:24:01.296
PEDESTRIANS AND MAKE OUR STREETS SAFER FOR OUR MOST

00:24:01.296 --> 00:24:05.367
VULNERABLE RESIDENTS AND IN MY VIEW ENFORCEMENT MUST BE IN THE

00:24:05.367 --> 00:24:08.367
TOOLBOX. SECONDLY, COLLEAGUES TODAY I'M

00:24:08.637 --> 00:24:09.971
