WAIVER BASED ON A BOARD FINDING THAT THE WAIVER WOULD BE IN THE

00:24:31.593 --> 00:24:34.529
BEST INTEREST OF THE PUBLIC. >> IN THE THREE YEARS SINCE

00:24:34.529 --> 00:24:38.199
POPPY'S PASSAGE THIS BOARD HAS BEEN ASKED FOR AND ALLOWED AS

00:24:38.199 --> 00:24:39.534
DID PAYMENT WAIVERS TO PROCURE FIRE TRUCKS FOR THE SAN

00:24:39.534 --> 00:24:42.270
FRANCISCO FIRE DEPARTMENT, EXPAND SHELTER BEDS, DELIVER

00:24:42.270 --> 00:24:46.700
IMMIGRANT LEGAL SERVICES, ADDRESS THE FENTANYL CRISIS

00:24:46.700 --> 00:24:50.110
AND THE LIST GOES ON AND ON. HOWEVER, FOR REASONS THAT ARE

00:24:50.110 --> 00:24:51.546
NOT CLEAR TO ME HAVE NEVER BEEN CLEAR TO ME PROP E DOES NOT

00:24:51.546 --> 00:24:54.483
ALLOW MEMBERS OF THE BOARD OF SUPERVISORS TO SEEK OR OBTAIN

00:24:54.483 --> 00:24:57.219
SUCH WAIVERS. IN MY VIEW THAT EXCLUSION MAKES

00:24:57.219 --> 00:24:58.153
NO SENSE. SUPERVISORS ARE OFTEN THE

00:24:58.153 --> 00:25:01.364
CLOSEST TO OUR COMMUNITIES. WE HEAR DIRECTLY FROM NEIGHBORS

00:25:01.364 --> 00:25:04.233
AND COMMUNITY ORGANIZATIONS ABOUT THEIR NEEDS AND WE'RE

00:25:04.233 --> 00:25:07.833
WELL-POSITIONED TO HELP DIRECT PHILANTHROPIC PHILANTHROPIC

00:25:07.837 --> 00:25:09.380
DOLLARS TOWARD URGENT AND EMERGING PRIORITIES.

00:25:09.380 --> 00:25:12.908
YET AMONG ELECTED AND APPOINTED OFFICIALS WE ARE AGAIN UNIQUELY

00:25:12.908 --> 00:25:16.312
EXCLUDED FROM THE POSSIBILITY OF A WAIVER NO MATTER THE

00:25:16.312 --> 00:25:17.380
PUBLIC INTEREST THAT MIGHT BE SERVED.

00:25:17.380 --> 00:25:23.319
HAPPILY, THIS EXCLUSION CAN BE CHANGED BY A TWO THIRDS VOTE OF

00:25:23.319 --> 00:25:24.654
