THE ORDINANCE I'M INTRODUCING TODAY WOULD ALLOW THE BOARD TO

00:25:38.735 --> 00:25:41.604
GRANT WAIVERS TO SUPERVISORS BASED ON THE SAME FINDING OF

00:25:41.604 --> 00:25:45.274
